    "5": {
      "note": "The reference distinguishes per-use host/role choices and permission authority from retained accepted-but-unread settings. Its correct-input canonical-amendment passage keeps read/check/validation/sync refusals, starts, product guards and commit gates as stops, and when no admitted route works the write is made openly by hand and logged.\n\nAnchor: `correct-input write-refusal procedure`",
