      "note": "The user-owned nonnested stepUp alternative defaults afterTries to three only for Worker/Curator recorded code/memory rounds; record-only repeats do not count. Next-start validation and idle replacement preserve permission, host-default provenance, task decisions and review limits; removing it affects later starts only.",
